cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MOLRAPTOR: Molecular Learning via Rapid Processing of Topological Representations"
version: "0.1.1"
date-released: "2026-05-28"
authors:
  - family-names: "Contreras-Torres"
    given-names: "Flavio F."
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-2375-131X"
    affiliation: "Tecnologico de Monterrey"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NanoBiostructuresRG/molraptor"
license: "LGPL-3.0-or-later"
abstract: >-
  MOLRAPTOR is a modular pipeline for fetching, curating, and encoding
  molecular datasets using PubChem data and RDKit's Morgan fingerprinting
  algorithm. It automates the preparation of molecular datasets for
  cheminformatics workflows and phase 1 machine learning applications
  within the computational drug discovery pipeline.
keywords:
  - cheminformatics
  - molecular fingerprints
  - Morgan fingerprints
  - PubChem
  - RDKit
  - drug discovery
  - machine learning
  - computational chemistry